  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "短影音與廣告創作",
    "sub_ename": "CREATIVE SHORT VIDEO PRODUCTION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生掌握短影音與數位廣告的核心技能，結合影像製作與數位行銷策略，完成品牌導向的創意作品。課程將涵蓋短影片的企劃、拍攝、剪輯與發表過程，強調故事敘述與視覺傳達，幫助學生理解如何通過動態影像傳遞品牌價值。同時，學生將學習運用各大社群平台進行數位行銷，增強實務能力，提升在數位影音領域的競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course develops students' core skills in short-video creation and digital advertising by combining video production with digital marketing strategies to create brand-oriented work. Students will learn the complete process of short film production—from planning and shooting to editing and publishing—with an emphasis on storytelling and visual communication. The course teaches how to effectively convey brand value through dynamic visuals while mastering digital marketing across social media platforms. Through hands-on practice, students will enhance their practical skills and boost their competitiveness in the digital media field.",
